<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B0D14', padding: '56px 72px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F4FF' }}>先算清代价，再谈智能</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A90A6' }}>左边是它在这套 180 天数据里真找出来的，右边是按建议执行后的测算</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5064', letterSpacing: 2 }}>AI 掌柜</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 8 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.15, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A90A6', letterSpacing: 1 }}>实测 · 系统自己发现的五件事</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 14, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 0 }}>
          <Box style={{ paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #242A3D', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6C6CF5', width: 96 }}>11.1%</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F2F4FF' }}>近 7 天折扣率，比前 30 天的 8.8% 高 2.3 个点</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #242A3D', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6C6CF5', width: 96 }}>1,899</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F2F4FF' }}>元 · 按原折扣水平本可少让的金额</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #242A3D', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6C6CF5', width: 96 }}>19 道</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F2F4FF' }}>菜连续 3 天 0 销量，占在售 9.2%</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #242A3D', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6C6CF5', width: 96 }}>5 种</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F2F4FF' }}>食材可支撑不足 2 天（基围虾只剩 1.5 天）</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12, borderTop: '1px solid #242A3D', borderBottom: '1px solid #242A3D', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#6C6CF5', width: 96 }}>57.6%</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F2F4FF' }}>近 30 天毛利率，比目标低 2.4 个点</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#171A2E', border: '1px solid #6C6CF5', borderRadius: 14, padding: 30, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6C6CF5', letterSpacing: 1 }}>测算 · 补齐这 2.4 个点</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F4FF', letterSpacing: -1 }}>+9.4<span style={{ fontSize: 22 }}> 万/年</span></Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A90A6' }}>近 30 天营收 32.5 万 × 2.4pt × 12 个月</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, marginTop: 6, paddingTop: 16, borderTop: '1px solid #3A3F63' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#F2F4FF' }}>怎么补：</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A90A6', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>① 3 道瘦狗菜调价 5%~15%<br />② 19 道滞销菜组套餐或下架<br />③ 折扣收回 2 个点</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#6B6F8A', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>
          左列全部由 SQL 从 180 天数据算出，脚本可复现；右侧为按当前规模的线性测算，不是承诺值。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 36, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5064' }}>2026 武汉 1024 · 产业应用赛道</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#4A5064' }}>09 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>